     16  0ba7		       8d 04 de 	      sta	ACIA_CTRL
     17  0baa							; (fall into the test)
     18  0baa
     19  0baa							; Does the MIDI chip's interrupt reach the C64? (v0.16) Ask for one (the
     20  0baa							; transmit-empty interrupt asks at once) with the timer quiet: if it comes,
     21  0baa							; the MIDI chip interrupts when a byte comes in or can go out (IrqMidi) and
     22  0baa							; the timer only ticks the ms. If not, poll it 4000 times a second (Irq) as
     23  0baa							; before. Interrupts are off when this is called.
     24  0baa				   MidiIrqTest
